Fixed: Treat two eigenvalues of the log-conformation tensor as equal in the logarithmic evolution of IBAMR::CFUpperConvectiveOperator if they differ by less than the square root of machine epsilon, in two and three spatial dimensions. The kernel for three spatial dimensions previously tested the wrong pair of eigenvalues, which gave wrong diagonal components and could divide by zero.
